      "item_body": "<p>[K/U] For each function, find the critical points. Use the first derivative test to state whether each point is a local maximum, a local minimum, or neither.</p>\n<p>a. y = x^4 - 8x^2; critical points: <span id=\"blank_548635ca-c3a8-4dd1-98f7-daec65ae7d88\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_a43faceb-06ae-4eb3-b556-a5c4f68b4a71\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_9de3c667-9c47-4ff8-ac73-4e1c96aa421f\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_08046854-3956-45e9-8e9b-38aeac36ccda\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_765df59b-0d5f-4a5d-a657-896caf2b920d\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_25221268-6e1b-4bf7-afdd-8b17ba8cb944\"></span>)</p>\n<p>b. f(x) = 2x/(x^2 + 9); critical points: <span id=\"blank_94ed84e9-f8df-4652-abf8-27ef8f97052d\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_c97ab667-d259-4617-b679-b8967394738f\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_0ab3a742-c175-4fdb-aeba-e0c9ab7060c0\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_1a25cacb-55c5-4462-bc34-a24474a52df1\"></span>)</p>\n<p>c. y = x^3 + 3x^2 + 1; critical points: <span id=\"blank_3437ceb5-b4ac-42cf-a0d1-e06ed75a61d9\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_9dc7cfdb-f1c6-4933-a614-edccb3ae5827\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_66ae29a1-abe0-4e83-9920-6ba8f8c0129f\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_691ebe02-ddff-425e-9366-1ed251a51e9b\"></span>)</p>",
